  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the chopped onion and cook for 3-4 minutes, until softened.",
    "stir in the cumin powder, coriander powder, and red pepper flakes.",
    "add the crushed tomatoes, vegetable broth, salt, and parsley.",
    "bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 15-20 minutes, until the tomatoes are broken down and the stew has thickened.",
    "stir in the lemon juice and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "cook the quinoa according to package instructions and fluff with a fork.",
    "serve the quinoa topped with the tomato tagine and garnished with additional parsley if desired.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
